 "group": "chat",
 "title": "What listens on port 8080?",
 "description": "ss shows the listener on 0.0.0.0:8080 but, as an unprivileged user, cannot name the process (it belongs to a Docker proxy of another user). The system prompt tells the model to also check containers. Correct answer: the qbittorrent container (web UI port 8080). Tests that the model does not stop at 'ss shows no process' and combines a second source (container ports, or the process list showing --webui-port=8080), whether by hand or with the listening_ports tool that does the join.",
